            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>At a recent Transcatheter Therapeutics meeting in San Francisco the PROSPECT Trial was presented by Dr. Greg Stone. Prospect stands for Providing Regional Observations to Study Predictors of Events in the Coronary Tree. This was a natural history study of atherosclerosis using multi-modality intracoronary imaging to prospectively identify vulnerable plaque. More on this later.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
